{"sha": "89d849061a4f54d902acf97ed27ecabba5363d1c9fe545968a49c602516f1901", "body": ["{\\small 偶数可以平均分成两行；奇数总会", "多出一个单独的点。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:numbers:1}", "用数字写出：“两千三百四十五”；“六千零五十”；", "“九千零一”。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:numbers:2}", "用文字写出：$1\\,208$；\\quad $4\\,070$；\\quad $9\\,999$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:numbers:3}", "在 $7\\,382$ 中，十位上的数字是几？千位上的", "数字是几？这个数一共含有多少个\\emph{百}", "（注意：不只是百位上的数字，可参考", "\\cref{ex:g3:numbers:exchange}）？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:numbers:4}", "仿照\\cref{def:g3:numbers:place}，将下列各数分解：", "$5\\,631$；\\quad $2\\,046$；\\quad $8\\,500$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:numbers:5}", "抄写下列各式，并在空处填入 $<$ 或 $>$：", "\\[", "456 \\;?\\; 465, \\qquad", "1\\,203 \\;?\\; 989, \\qquad", "6\\,090 \\;?\\; 6\\,009, \\qquad", "9\\,999 \\;?\\; 10\\,000 .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:numbers:6}", "从小到大排列：$530$；\\ $3\\,500$；\\ $353$；\\ $5\\,033$；", "\\ $503$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:numbers:7}", "在一条以百为单位刻度、从 $0$ 到 $1\\,000$ 的数轴上，", "大致标出数 $150$、$480$、$820$ 和 $990$ 的位置。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:numbers:8}", "是偶数还是奇数？\\ $34$；\\ $57$；\\ $70$；\\ $2\\,481$；\\ $6\\,548$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:numbers:9}", "按步长数一数：从 $2\\,970$ 出发，每次加 $10$，数五步；从 $860$ 出发，", "每次加 $100$，数四步；从 $9\\,996$ 出发，每次加 $1$，数四步。", "数到最后一个时，你发现了什么？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:numbers:10}", "用数字 $3$、$7$、$0$、$5$ 各恰好用一次，写出", "可能的最大四位数，再写出最小的四位数（一个数", "不能以 $0$ 开头）。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:numbers:11}", "我是一个三位数。我的数字是 $2$、$5$ 和 $8$，我是偶数，", "并且比 $800$ 大。我是谁？", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}